  "id": "aerobic-exercise",
  "term": "aerobic exercise",
  "definition": "Aerobic exercise is a form of physical activity discussed in research on mental functioning and well-being, including its effects on mood, cognition, and sleep. In the supplied evidence, single sessions were linked to short-term mood improvement, while longer-term participation was associated mainly with reduced negative mood.",
